<title>NEW ZEALAND: Sky City to release yr result on Aug 25.</title>
<headline>Sky City to release yr result on Aug 25.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino owner Sky City Ltd said on Friday  it would announce its full year result to June 30 on Monday, August  25.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
<p>e-mail wellington.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
